# Rust build output. This crate has no committed Cargo.lock (a library
# consumed as a git dependency, not a top-level pinned application) — the
# exact acadrust rev is already pinned in Cargo.toml's `rev = "..."`, which
# is the load-bearing pin for reproducibility; Cargo.lock would only add a
# second, redundant, easily-stale pin for this crate's own dependencies.
